@startuml
title Semantic Web Application Architecture

' External actors/clients as components
component "Web Browser" as Browser
component "API Client" as ApiClient

' Interfaces from the draft
interface "Browser UI Access" as BrowserUI
interface "Authenticated Web/API Interface" as WebAPI
interface "Semantic Processing Interface" as SemanticAPI

' Core application components
component "Web Frontend" as WebFrontend
component "API Gateway" as ApiGateway
component "Authentication Service" as AuthService
component "Semantic Processor" as SemanticProcessor
component "Knowledge Graph Store" as KnowledgeGraph
component "Document Repository" as DocumentRepo

' Browser interactions
Browser --> BrowserUI : uses
BrowserUI - WebFrontend : provided by

' API client interactions
ApiClient --> WebAPI : uses
WebAPI - ApiGateway : provided by

' Internal routing and authentication
WebFrontend --> WebAPI : calls
WebFrontend --> SemanticAPI : calls
ApiGateway --> AuthService : validates credentials
ApiGateway --> SemanticAPI : routes semantic requests

' Semantic processing and persistence
SemanticProcessor - SemanticAPI : provides
SemanticProcessor --> KnowledgeGraph : reads/writes
SemanticProcessor --> DocumentRepo : reads/writes

@enduml
